Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:46.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢达心灵的光芒？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:52.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了！不要消失！
